GAP|lane=index-language-measurement-gaps|text=The translucent in the four-point ordering. He said 'the translucent first, THEN the three combined'; the four-point run did the three combined and skipped the translucent entirely. Laws 30–33 define translucent for the DRILL ordering (tip before red), but nothing defines what a translucent PREDICTOR is in the four-point frame. That mapping does not exist.|json=0
