GAP|lane=sealed-ledger-laws-0-26|text=Law 18 (The Black Gradient is a Generator) carries NO 'MEASURED:' line and NO numeric receipt. 'A compressor IS a model IS a generator' and 'the reachable family is the model's typical set, a real, walkable object' are prose. No count of derived variants, no seed list, no size of the reachable family.|json=0
GAP|lane=sealed-ledger-laws-0-26|text=Law 23 (Fischer Slice Agent) is the only one of the four slice agents (23–26) WITHOUT a 'MEASURED:' tag. It gives one exact worked value (g^77777 on (Z/1000081Z)* reads [−0−]) but no test count, no receipt, no cluster benchmark for the claimed √-scaling per tower.|json=0
GAP|lane=sealed-ledger-laws-0-26|text=No named artifact/script for Laws 0–12, 17, 18, 21, and 23–26. Named scripts exist only for Law 13 (rime_sphere.py), Law 14 (rime_fischer.py), Law 15 (rime_run.py), Law 16 (rime_dimension.py), Law 19 (unrhyme.py), Law 20 (rime_prism.py), Law 22 (rime_cascade27.py). The remaining eighteen measurements cannot be re-run from this file.|json=0
